<p>The bounded search tries quarter-hour starts and the original start, keeping the same time across each repeated plan. It keeps up to32 alternatives at each step. It is a checked suggestion, not proof of the best possible timetable or a whole-year automatic allocation. If no improvement is found, no work moves.</p>
